{"unit_id":"tag:042E:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>本节找出代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的某些性质，我们（尚）不能证明这些性质在fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）中是基底局部的（local on the base），但它们在fppf拓扑（topology）中是基底局部的（local on the base）。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑","context":"拓扑类型，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"拓扑类型，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
