{"unit_id":"tag:042U:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的基底变换（base change）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>若<MATH_0006>是一个浸入（immersion），则每个<MATH_0007>都是浸入（immersion），由《空间》的引理<REF_0001>。这证明了定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>反过来，假设每个<MATH_0008>都是浸入（immersion）。由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0003>，这蕴含每个<MATH_0009>都是分离的（separated）。由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0004>，这蕴含每个<MATH_0010>都是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）。因此，应用引理<REF_0005>和<REF_0006>，可知<MATH_0011>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）且分离的（separated）。由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0007>，这蕴含<MATH_0012>是可表的（representable）！\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0008>，只需证明对每个概形（scheme）<MATH_0013>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>，基底变换（base change）<MATH_0015>是浸入（immersion）。由《空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》的引理<REF_0009>，可以找到一个由概形（schemes）构成的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0016>，它细化了覆盖（covering）<MATH_0017>到<MATH_0018>的拉回（pullback）。因此可知，将<MATH_0019>（根据上一段的结果，它是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism））拉回到<MATH_0020>的一个由概形（schemes）构成的fppf覆盖的各个成员上后，它成为一个浸入（immersion）。因此，由概形（schemes）的对应结果，<MATH_0021>是一个浸入（immersion），见《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0010>。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖","context":"覆盖类型，待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换","context":"运算，待决。"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"态射类型，待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节名称，待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"可表性，待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节名称，待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖，待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"运算，待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"章节名称，待决。"}],"notes":["原文 an fppf (by schemes) 忠实理解为由概形构成的 fppf 覆盖。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:042F:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是局部分离的（locally separated）”是fppf基底局部的（local on the base）。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:042F:proof","translation":"局部分离的（locally separated）态射（morphism）的基底变换（base change）是局部分离的（locally separated），见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0001>。因此得到定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>设<MATH_0001>是一个fppf覆盖（fppf covering），其对象为<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。设<MATH_0003>是一个态射（morphism），其源和目标为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。假设每个基底变换（base change）<MATH_0005>都是局部分离的（locally separated）。这意味着每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>都是一个浸入（immersion）。fppf覆盖（fppf covering）的基底变换（base change）是fppf覆盖（fppf covering），见《空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》的引理<REF_0003>，因此<MATH_0007>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）。此外，每个<MATH_0008>都是态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>的基底变换（base change）。因此，由引理<REF_0004>得到<MATH_0010>是一个浸入（immersion），即<MATH_0011>是局部分离的（locally separated）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部